# playCheckmateSound(Player player)
# Plays the "checkmate" sound. Fires from inside checkGameOver when
# isCheckmate returns true. Plays at the same moment as the
# "*** Checkmate! XXX wins. ***" chat message.
# CHANGE the sound name below.

@using rychess
@fast

@bypass /playsound minecraft:ui.toast.challenge_complete master @a[x=-9134.0,y=-61.0,z=9669.0,distance=..20] -9134.0 -61.0 9669.0 1 1
